      "extract": "The main conclusion of this work is that the low energy chiral limit of the QCD partition function as derived by Leutwyler and Smilga coincides with a large N limit of a random matrix theory. Therefore all conclusions of [2] also pertain to the chiral random matrix theory proposed in section 2. The random matrix theory resembles the partition function of a gas of instantons. The main diﬀerence is that instead of",
